<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="TDbP8" id="TDbP8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uaaa6c718" id="uaaa6c718">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u6043299b" id="u6043299b"> 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐍𝐅𝐓: 𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐅𝐨𝐫𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐜𝐞𝐬𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u4d7e971b" id="u4d7e971b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95407bb5" id="u95407bb5">在线强化学习在大语言模型的后训练中发挥关键作用，推动近年来大语言模型在对齐与推理能力方面的进展。然而，要在视觉生成领域的扩散模型上取得类似成功，并非易事</span></strong></p><ul list="u7f3109e7"><li fid="u0e18a202" data-lake-id="u5ff6819b" id="u5ff6819b"><span data-lake-id="u4ee2195b" id="u4ee2195b">策略梯度算法假设模型的似然能够被精确计算。这一假设对于自回归模型成立，但扩散模型在本质上并不满足这一条件：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u57b7c849" id="u57b7c849" style="color: #5C0036">其似然只能通过计算开销较高的概率常微分方程，或随机微分方程的变分界进行近似估计</span></strong></li><li fid="u0e18a202" data-lake-id="uec827309" id="uec827309"><span data-lake-id="u9ee44458" id="u9ee44458">近期研究通过离散化逆向采样过程，将扩散生成重新表述为多步决策问题，从而绕过这一障碍。这种处理使相邻步骤之间的转移成为易于计算的高斯分布，因而能够将 GRPO 等现有强化学习算法直接应用于扩散模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd15f46e" id="udd15f46e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uda4f91b3" id="uda4f91b3">尽管这些工作取得有希望的进展，但作者认为，GRPO 风格的扩散强化学习仍然面临以下根本性局限</span></strong></p><ul list="u04bde349"><li fid="ucb2aa3d8" data-lake-id="u252bdb7c" id="u252bdb7c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66c23fd9" id="u66c23fd9">前向不一致性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9308a6e5" id="u9308a6e5">仅关注逆向采样过程，会破坏模型与前向扩散过程的一致性，使模型面临退化为级联高斯模型的风险</span></li><li fid="ucb2aa3d8" data-lake-id="u06f054ae" id="u06f054ae"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73fe8d1c" id="u73fe8d1c">求解器限制：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucdabc62a" id="ucdabc62a">数据收集过程依赖一阶 SDE 采样器，无法充分利用 ODE 求解器或高阶求解器，而这些求解器是流模型的默认选择，有利于提高生成效率</span></li><li fid="ucb2aa3d8" data-lake-id="u0661bbe0" id="u0661bbe0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e66c201" id="u9e66c201">与 CFG 的集成较为复杂：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc0d7b28b" id="uc0d7b28b">扩散模型高度依赖无分类器引导，这需要同时训练条件模型与无条件模型。现有强化学习方法通常在后训练中引入 CFG，从而形成复杂且低效的双模型优化方案</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u33aacaa0" id="u33aacaa0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf74057df" id="uf74057df" style="color: #E4495B">的目标是，在扩散强化学习中解耦数据收集过程、消除求解器限制，并保持与标准监督预训练的一致性。由于一个扩散策略对应单一的前向加噪过程，却可以对应多个逆向去噪过程，例如使用不同的采样器，因此，一个自然的问题是：能否在前向过程而非逆向过程中，对扩散模型进行强化学习？</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6cec3725" id="u6cec3725" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791183578002-bcfa41d3-207d-4919-a94d-8c2b1155e166.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0f33e4c5-08a5-47aa-a133-3fd360e9999%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub414d13d-03b9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A820.8%2C%22height%22%3A214%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A78319%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1026%2C%22originHeight%22%3A267%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83OA(XXT%2B)GRPO%2FPPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A319%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISCRETIZEDREVERSESDEPROCESSR(XO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A423%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLACK-BOXSOLVER%22%2C%22x%22%3A150%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SRXOHORWARDPROCESS%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TE(XTXT%2B1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A662%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLD(XT%22%2C%22x%22%3A741%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TSTOREDDAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(XT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X11X2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A382%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R(XO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROPT%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(XOLX1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A483%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%8112%22%2C%22x%22%3A450%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227(XO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X0%22%2C%22x%22%3A540%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A71%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u83d3779e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uded1e0e6"><li fid="u0ac38f9a" data-lake-id="uf0ea6476" id="uf0ea6476"><span data-lake-id="u2b80a19d" id="u2b80a19d">本文提出一种新的在线强化学习范式，称为扩散负样本感知微调。DiffusionNFT 不再基于传统的策略梯度框架，而是通过流匹配目标，直接在前向扩散过程中进行策略优化。直观而言，该方法依据奖励信号，将生成样本划分为正样本和负样本，在分别基于这两类样本学习得到的两个隐式策略之间定义对比式改进方向，并在不修改采样过程的情况下，朝正样本策略的方向进行优化</span></li><li fid="u0ac38f9a" data-lake-id="ud5e0dba9" id="ud5e0dba9"><span data-lake-id="u16c6b78d" id="u16c6b78d">这种基于前向过程的强化学习形式化带来多项实际优势。首先，DiffusionNFT 允许使用任意黑盒求解器收集数据，而不再依赖一阶 SDE 采样器。其次，它无需存储完整的采样轨迹，策略优化仅需要无噪图像。再次，它与标准扩散模型训练完全兼容，只需对现有代码库进行少量修改。最后，它是一种原生的离策略算法，无需重要性采样，即可自然地将训练策略与采样策略解耦</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue7fac800" id="ue7fac800"><strong><span data-lake-id="u365f2870" id="u365f2870">DiffusionNFT 为传统策略梯度方法提供一种直接强化学习的替代方案，将负样本感知微调范式引入扩散模型领域。以监督学习为基础，这一范式为构建跨模态的通用、统一且原生支持离策略学习的强化学习方案，提供一条可行路径</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="brzls" id="brzls" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4d780b2c" id="u4d780b2c">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u54c17f3e" id="u54c17f3e"> 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udc8d2b40" id="udc8d2b40"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf516a78e" id="uf516a78e">扩散模型通过前向过程，使用高斯噪声逐步扰动干净数据</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_0%3Dp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fe820b80ec0ed4729b9baf6882022ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fvEcF%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud46fb8ec" id="ud46fb8ec">，从而学习连续数据分布。随后，通过学习逆转这一过程，即可生成数据</span></strong></p><ul list="udbfef868"><li fid="ubfb6e054" data-lake-id="u196eb649" id="u196eb649"><span data-lake-id="u6092ec2b" id="u6092ec2b">给定噪声调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1a822952fd86be10ddc181471a412e97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zPPfT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d40f204" id="u1d40f204">前向加噪过程具有闭式形式的转移核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid%200%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Calpha_t%20x_0%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9dbfe3462b9846cbaef4c3ccddb38ee1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YTBhs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32ad371a" id="u32ad371a">，因此可以进行如下重参数化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub7734609" id="ub7734609" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%20x_0%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f0d47d547385ccb9c07b10da94dc445.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WzEYw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9edc900d"><li fid="ubc4cc4de" data-lake-id="uc98d2254" id="uc98d2254"><span data-lake-id="u64e3e092" id="u64e3e092">学习扩散模型的一种方式，是采用速度参数化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c7b18a8bc53a76deeff00164551df01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oB1o2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc12a273d" id="uc12a273d">，预测轨迹的切向量，并通过最小化以下目标进行训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u926a1f2a" id="u926a1f2a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%5C%5C%2Cx_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_0%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bw(t)%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)-v%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc3e8f4f83ec4cdd26386a715e0835cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oM5wI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u30fadc74"><li fid="u216d751d" data-lake-id="uc638b2a3" id="uc638b2a3"><span data-lake-id="u91d31d3c" id="u91d31d3c">其中，目标速度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dxh2U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae13f4a1" id="uae13f4a1">由噪声调度关于时间的导数定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%3D%5C%5Cdot%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20x_0%2B%5C%5Cdot%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D_t%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F80231779f89c1962b48def984a4b3a7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kn3Yc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3360be73" id="u3360be73">，记号</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdot%7Bf%7D_t%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Df_t%2F%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5e0f3b22b29094007b3822efa51226a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G994c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u290189fe" id="u290189fe">表示对时间求导，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1015bd678f4bc6451d770a80c742cce1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Txo6k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01e7279b" id="u01e7279b">为某个加权函数</span></li><li fid="u216d751d" data-lake-id="uf21bff3b" id="uf21bff3b"><span data-lake-id="u8950a67a" id="u8950a67a">逆向采样通常遵循扩散模型的常微分方程形式；采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd85da554ec76d3f694107121e1392b96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22McdjR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u296a162c" id="u296a162c">参数化后，该方程简化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dx_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%3Dv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc3830004a469bc0025d27469d353be99.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gsnh3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71857477" id="u71857477">。这一形式化称为流匹配，其中，简单的欧拉离散化即可作为有效的 ODE 求解器，并与 DDIM 等价</span></li><li fid="u216d751d" data-lake-id="uf103a91e" id="uf103a91e"><span data-lake-id="ue5c770d9" id="ue5c770d9">Rectified Flow 可以视为上述扩散模型的一种特例，其噪声调度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%3D1-t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c7b5d8baf30394ea462724e89586eb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22To025%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u252be38e" id="u252be38e">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3Dt%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4c794cec204e6ed29eadeddd28b2db7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TufF8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c20e7d1" id="u5c20e7d1">，从而将目标速度简化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%3D%5C%5Cepsilon-x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F383f4affbcca7d586d43ef2837d6512b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y9X1b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec5e3bec" id="uec5e3bec">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uda9345df" id="uda9345df"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04e0fe1b" id="u04e0fe1b">面向扩散模型的策略梯度算法：为将 PPO 或 GRPO 等策略梯度算法应用于扩散模型，近期研究将扩散采样形式化为一个多步马尔可夫决策过程。这一点可以通过离散化扩散模型的逆向采样过程来实现</span></strong></p><ul list="ub1406be9"><li fid="ue7efd068" data-lake-id="u7f54d4a0" id="u7f54d4a0"><span data-lake-id="u352dcd32" id="u352dcd32">尽管流模型天然能够通过 ODE 进行简单、高效的采样，但缺乏随机性阻碍 GRPO 的应用。FlowGRPO 通过采用速度参数化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd85da554ec76d3f694107121e1392b96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ojHSP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd38c4cc" id="ucd38c4cc">下的随机微分方程形式来解决这一问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7524c1a7" id="u7524c1a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dx_t%3D%5C%5Cleft%5Bv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg_t%5E2%7D%7B2t%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_t%2B(1-t)v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%2Bg_t%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dw_t.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1a201a9eccfec89da9c0a4d5fb9455d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lUXc2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf7405802"><li fid="ub2eff92e" data-lake-id="u865e019d" id="u865e019d"><span data-lake-id="uc7c3df53" id="uc7c3df53">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_t%3Da%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7B1-t%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdaaea8236b25e757f0fb3fd3bf422da6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JlwQX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9afc93b7" id="u9afc93b7">控制所注入随机性的强度。采用欧拉方法对其进行离散化，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ce70bbc" id="u6ce70bbc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_t%2B%5C%5Cleft%5Bv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg_t%5E2%7D%7B2t%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_t%2B(1-t)v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5CDelta%20t%2C%5C%5C%3Bg_t%5E2%5C%5CDelta%20t%5C%5C%2CI%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec4ca685c490fe93ac0c174ad5133eda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bmi9A%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0e8b8a77"><li fid="u9c10024c" data-lake-id="uc54552c7" id="uc54552c7"><span data-lake-id="u8e5f4c93" id="u8e5f4c93">这样，相邻步骤之间的转移核便成为似然可计算的高斯分布，从而能够直接应用 GRPO 等现有策略梯度算法</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="vNyxp" id="vNyxp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5fa422f1" id="u5fa422f1">⛵</span><span data-lake-id="ua76f91e8" id="ua76f91e8"> 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐍𝐞𝐠𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞-𝐀𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐭𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u322f85ef" id="u322f85ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="uff0a35c3" id="uff0a35c3">在线强化学习：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uefcc585f" id="uefcc585f">考虑一个预训练的扩散策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec7a1145033857098f5d28785659fc07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ahP6K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0c79402" id="uc0c79402">，以及提示数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bc%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff79442f1d671d3352a36b31ec2d39c9c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yFvsT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ae87684" id="u4ae87684">。在每次迭代中，针对提示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pshwK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd43ea1b" id="ucd43ea1b">采样生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mGPPw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46de54a1" id="u46de54a1">张图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%5E%7B1%3AK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75f120081850e7720592c93f6198249a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KiddT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55903169" id="u55903169">，随后使用标量奖励函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e24e9e095ad694af71516ec6a6cc544.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FhIvp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua832a71d" id="ua832a71d">评估每张图像。该奖励表示图像的最优性概率，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x_0%2Cc)%3A%3Dp(o%3D1%5C%5Cmid%20x_0%2Cc)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1da5478bbda08941777929edea36015c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DNbWb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb9bb45d" id="ubb9bb45d">​</span></p><ul list="uca0c65fd"><li fid="udfe8f456" data-lake-id="u7dd9621b" id="u7dd9621b"><span data-lake-id="uf9f266e2" id="uf9f266e2">这一最优性概念将连续值奖励与二元划分联系起来。收集到的数据可以随机划分为两个假想子集：图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U7kiR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1180413b" id="u1180413b">以概率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ctfci%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9f34d20" id="ue9f34d20">被划入正样本数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf3b8cb25bcf3e7d6130e99b40fc3198.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YPKay%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u964bc275" id="u964bc275">，否则被划入负样本数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77a364ec86baac173d80ce31aa407219.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kmo90%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71e5599b" id="u71e5599b">。在样本数量无限的情况下，这两个子集对应的底层分布分别为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9ecb7845" id="u9ecb7845" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%3A%3D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20o%3D1%2Cc)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(o%3D1%5C%5Cmid%20x_0%2Cc)%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o%3D1%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Br(x_0%2Cc)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o%3D1%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3708226695cf4218cf187a948cf8a913.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AbckB%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uda4917f1" id="uda4917f1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B-%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%3A%3D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20o%3D0%2Cc)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(o%3D0%5C%5Cmid%20x_0%2Cc)%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o%3D0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-r(x_0%2Cc)%7D%7B1-p_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o%3D1%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3a2af48c5faf356d751075091c088b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XS0Ok%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufbd7612d"><li fid="ue98a3fbc" data-lake-id="u8e390a70" id="u8e390a70"><span data-lake-id="udfcc51c5" id="udfcc51c5">强化学习要求在每次迭代中进行策略改进。优化后的策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d2dbd42958bc6d9faad4ccbf3cddc1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uEJOz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e71e52f" id="u4e71e52f">应满足</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6167ddad" id="u6167ddad" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B*%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7Dr(x_0%2Cc)%3E%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7Dr(x_0%2Cc).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad1a0c3c4133388ff5ec224f63d684e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a8a0V%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufb6125d3" id="ufb6125d3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d789e9e" id="u0d789e9e">基于正样本数据的策略改进：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf6fa1d6a" id="uf6fa1d6a">容易证明，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%5C%5Csucc%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%5C%5Csucc%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb85a49c3782b4e34f28c2d45ed0db74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fbb1A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uace57767" id="uace57767"> 始终成立，一种直接改进</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec7a1145033857098f5d28785659fc07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HTZfi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef7953a8" id="uef7953a8">的方式是令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B*%7D%3D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c1e702ea7e9e05d2f7806fcd7263706.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PIew4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34a10018" id="u34a10018">。已有研究仅在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf3b8cb25bcf3e7d6130e99b40fc3198.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cYmbG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a8c680d" id="u8a8c680d">上进行扩散模型训练，这种方法称为拒绝采样微调。尽管方法简单，但 RFT 无法有效利用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77a364ec86baac173d80ce31aa407219.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NzvKE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0abd8f1" id="ua0abd8f1">中的负样本数据</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub5f39bed" id="ub5f39bed"><strong><span data-lake-id="u91c3533a" id="u91c3533a">强化引导：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9f18cea5" id="u9f18cea5">负反馈对于策略改进至关重要，尤其是对于扩散模型。不将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5f05ccc9f15f49528d7a4fe44d48952.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22isFrd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81022283" id="u81022283">仅仅视为一个待逼近的优化目标点，而是同时利用正样本和负样本数据，推导一个改进方向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fee14632c088b3cdc4f4f727b69ff6973.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ssFOM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ba79930" id="u5ba79930">。训练目标定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u432ba69e" id="u432ba69e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B*%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3A%3Dv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5CDelta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct).%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5383e8cafd7c3987f218e458439f5cf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PYu7R%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue2f4800b"><li fid="u8d1a4e54" data-lake-id="u25ecac82" id="u25ecac82"><span data-lake-id="ueefcae94" id="ueefcae94">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f7j17%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u19cdb24f" id="u19cdb24f">为扩散模型的速度预测器，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xFXJg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc69f629e" id="uc69f629e">为超参数。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6c12dbaa0d37b3f64b95d7fb2e81311.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P1BAP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82d27f2c" id="u82d27f2c">称为强化引导， </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d22543045aa02e1aa567bea2dabcd54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mo6UB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cfe5dac" id="u2cfe5dac">称为引导强度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucb395a70" id="ucb395a70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e086181" id="u0e086181">基于前向过程的负样本感知扩散强化学习：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UECJ7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufd385952" id="ufd385952">对应改进策略与原始策略之间的分布变化。首先研究满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%5C%5Csucc%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%5C%5Csucc%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb85a49c3782b4e34f28c2d45ed0db74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cKF89%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc23c7c18" id="uc23c7c18">的三个策略之间的分布差异</span></p><p data-lake-id="ude1aad57" id="ude1aad57"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd7ddd04" id="ucd7ddd04">定理 3.1（改进方向）。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uce5f559a" id="uce5f559a"> 考虑分别对应策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5f05ccc9f15f49528d7a4fe44d48952.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hWQE4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa8d1028" id="uaa8d1028">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F257b720310d4861c166c33020d81aa9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ib1kl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubaaf0702" id="ubaaf0702"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec7a1145033857098f5d28785659fc07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KPN72%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b351df1" id="u4b351df1"> 的扩散模型 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18aa96107888ba6c957befa105a73796.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22duPUT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4df6c43" id="ud4df6c43">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ed0a04c0ad9874ca13a26721ba45d6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QmXDX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u023bbfb7" id="u023bbfb7"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8855eb5171c6de552bf97a917ccb3cda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aQxrn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6807e07a" id="u6807e07a">。这些模型之间的方向差异成比例：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8136d745" id="u8136d745" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5CDelta%26%3A%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B1-%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cleft%5Bv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-v%5E%7B-%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%5C%5Cleft%5Bv%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ecfaf1a9515fb62ab23aef37298e3e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EfpB6%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8a0127f7" id="u8a0127f7"><span data-lake-id="uf3aebd2c" id="uf3aebd2c">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sVSS2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9bdfe255" id="u9bdfe255"> 为强化引导，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%5C%5Cleq1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa7b1b33c70bc15888453da32d321f81a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kfawC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1c437c4" id="uc1c437c4"> 为标量系数，定义为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6db89bb2" id="u6db89bb2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%3A%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_t%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7Dr(x_0%2Cc).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5b32dc2f555b241f8ac076976b8958d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fAvff%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u89a7319f" id="u89a7319f"><span data-lake-id="u2c2a3859" id="u2c2a3859">式（4）给出了相对于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8855eb5171c6de552bf97a917ccb3cda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FwGkH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66a780a0" id="u66a780a0"> 进行改进的理想引导方向 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AI4vg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cc7799f" id="u5cc7799f">。采用适当的引导强度，即可保证策略改进。例如，在式（3）中令 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%3D%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0a054d74adbbfc9abbe96d795967c34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OaUqN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubdecafb1" id="ubdecafb1">，则有：</span></p><p data-lake-id="udc2324b9" id="udc2324b9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B*%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3Dv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha(x_t)%7D%5C%5CDelta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3Dv%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83aa6efbd34059e99e30c51177bf084e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jfRBC%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud791f0b2" id="ud791f0b2"><span data-lake-id="u55e50651" id="u55e50651">因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B*%7D%3D%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%2B%7D%5C%5Csucc%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff678e26292bdc65f93154813682a005b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FyNiW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2c68919" id="ua2c68919"> 成立。图 3 展示了改进方向 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PLTtR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ab760e8" id="u1ab760e8"> 的示意。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u79b3e243" id="u79b3e243"><span data-lake-id="uf7d47dcb" id="uf7d47dcb">通过式（3）和式（4）定义了有效的优化目标 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f78f06dce3b7f30053efed97bb2346a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fyHMp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufbf83e8c" id="ufbf83e8c"> 之后，下面引入一个训练目标，直接优化 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd85da554ec76d3f694107121e1392b96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pqLgp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81b1e8d4" id="u81b1e8d4">，使其逼近 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f78f06dce3b7f30053efed97bb2346a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iae5v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c6743f6" id="u9c6743f6">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7a8f8745" id="u7a8f8745"><strong><span data-lake-id="u88825f5a" id="u88825f5a">定理 3.2（策略优化）。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue90ab3f8" id="ue90ab3f8"> 考虑以下训练目标：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u76aab1ae" id="u76aab1ae" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bc%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20c)%2C%5C%5C%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-v%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2B(1-r)%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B-%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-v%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F708b41e656106f49063627272cbe082b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UII1B%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61b875bf" id="u61b875bf"><span data-lake-id="uaa56b7ff" id="uaa56b7ff">其中，隐式正策略定义为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub274aa26" id="ub274aa26" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B%2B%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3A%3D(1-%5C%5Cbeta)v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cbeta%20v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f696255e4673a13da82d7543e6cdae7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j9mSW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub3eca332" id="ub3eca332"><span data-lake-id="u0a5a3e1a" id="u0a5a3e1a">隐式负策略定义为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3a9e20c7" id="u3a9e20c7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B-%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3A%3D(1%2B%5C%5Cbeta)v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-%5C%5Cbeta%20v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e2b7545b0706a64f6eaba59c8c52e21.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jbHwR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7f212f6b" id="u7f212f6b"><span data-lake-id="u46a3a406" id="u46a3a406">在数据量和模型容量不受限制的条件下，式（5）的最优解满足：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3751578e" id="u3751578e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B*%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%3Dv%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5CDelta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct).%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0645535d93005a688ed00f364d944868.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yVfIY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf2a34827" id="uf2a34827" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791185148314-345cef10-fd19-4a9e-859d-7db2bfb572f6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u677e1a41-5931-47af-b88e-122bc6220a5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5a86dc67-ca3f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A948.8%2C%22height%22%3A213%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A146009%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1186%2C%22originHeight%22%3A266%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMPLICITPOSITIVEPOLICY%22%2C%22x%22%3A749%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A236%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L(XC)-0%22%2C%22x%22%3A749%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L0G(XC-0L%22%2C%22x%22%3A740%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A269%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2BBIPLICITNEGATIVEPOLIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A699%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A293%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RL%3AKE0%2C1%5DOPTIMALITYREWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A340%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACUTEDOG%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OISYXK%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A37%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAGESXR%22%2C%22x%22%3A199%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONDITION%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NE%22%2C%22x%22%3A113%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A387%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%812%22%2C%22x%22%3A307%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%97%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A564%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A90%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AIEAAIEAAIEAIIEAIIIAIEAEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A210%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1eeed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u935795b5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udb292552" id="udb292552"><span data-lake-id="ua54e334d" id="ua54e334d">定理 3.2 提出了一种新的离策略强化学习范式，如图 4 所示。该方法不采用策略梯度，而是使用监督学习（Supervised Learning，SL）目标，同时额外利用在线负样本数据 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%5E%7B-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77a364ec86baac173d80ce31aa407219.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wzHnA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8604c192" id="u8604c192"> 进行训练。这使算法具有很强的通用性，并能够与现有监督学习方法兼容。我们将该方法命名为扩散负样本感知微调（Diffusion Negative-aware FineTuning，DiffusionNFT），以突出其负样本感知的监督学习本质，以及它与语言模型中并行发展的 NFT 算法（Chen et al., 2025c）在概念上的相似性。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4722dcc7" id="u4722dcc7"><span data-lake-id="ua765ba71" id="ua765ba71">下面讨论 DiffusionNFT 的几项独特优势。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufdb4b161" id="ufdb4b161"><strong><span data-lake-id="uce3f8c0f" id="uce3f8c0f">1. 前向一致性。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u25ea13aa" id="u25ea13aa"> 与 FlowGRPO 等在逆向扩散过程中构建强化学习的策略梯度方法不同，DiffusionNFT 在前向过程中定义标准的扩散损失。这保留了我们所称的前向一致性，即扩散模型的底层概率密度遵循福克–普朗克方程（Fokker–Planck equation）（Øksendal, 2003；Song et al., 2020b），从而确保学习得到的模型对应一个有效的前向过程。也就是说，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHoiR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u021b6fb4" id="u021b6fb4"> 与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YJBe1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47cf5364" id="u47cf5364"> 通过联合分布 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cx_0)%3D%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%5C%5Cpi_%7Bt%5C%5Cmid0%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcee4e0cd85985fb8467fca7b11bd8248.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aiEBw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u842377e9" id="u842377e9"> 正确耦合。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u23df861c" id="u23df861c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64b42598" id="u64b42598">2. 求解器灵活性。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u418c1838" id="u418c1838"> DiffusionNFT 将策略训练与数据采样完全解耦。因此，在整个采样过程中，可以充分利用任意黑盒求解器，而不必依赖一阶 SDE 采样器。此外，数据收集阶段无需存储完整采样轨迹，训练仅需要干净图像及其对应的奖励。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3af0a9f4" id="u3af0a9f4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u655b3a45" id="u655b3a45">3. 隐式引导整合。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c842680" id="u1c842680"> 直观而言，DiffusionNFT 定义引导方向 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rDzbY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ae7dd1d" id="u3ae7dd1d">，并将这一引导施加于旧策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8855eb5171c6de552bf97a917ccb3cda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nermy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub02ff9d8" id="ub02ff9d8">，如式（6）所示。然而，它并不单独学习引导模型 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9400911d70503accf9e6033af084bd8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lDTo1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2de28d6" id="ub2de28d6">，也不采用带引导的采样过程，而是通过隐式参数化技术，将强化引导直接整合进学习得到的策略。这一技术受到近期无引导训练研究（Chen et al., 2025a）的启发，使我们能够在单个策略模型上持续进行强化学习，这对于在线强化学习至关重要。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1f8f60a2" id="u1f8f60a2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5baebc65" id="u5baebc65">4. 无需似然的形式化。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u886f1d6b" id="u886f1d6b"> 此前的扩散强化学习方法，从根本上受到其对似然近似的依赖所限制。无论是使用变分界近似边缘数据似然，并应用 Jensen 不等式降低损失计算开销（Wallace et al., 2024），还是通过离散化逆向过程来估计序列似然（Black et al., 2023），都会不可避免地向扩散模型后训练中引入系统性估计偏差。相比之下，DiffusionNFT 本身无需似然计算，从而避免了这些折中。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2438815d" id="u2438815d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04d94049" id="u04d94049">最优性奖励。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86ff8633" id="u86ff8633"> 在大多数视觉强化学习场景中，奖励表现为不受取值范围约束的连续标量，而不是二元最优性信号。受现有 GRPO 实践（Shao et al., 2024；Liu et al., 2025；Xue et al., 2025）的启发，我们首先将原始奖励 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Braw%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F945d878fe69bde1a6060062a69731330.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GXlx3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea84fca2" id="uea84fca2"> 转换为表示最优性概率的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e24e9e095ad694af71516ec6a6cc544.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LYYTy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69d4da5a" id="u69d4da5a">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u627867a3" id="u627867a3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x_0%2Cc)%3A%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7Br%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Braw%7D%7D(x_0%2Cc)-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7Dr%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Braw%7D%7D(x_0%2Cc)%7D%7BZ_c%7D%2C-1%2C1%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc35b6d613df310f63866a669d5dac164.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vVO8X%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u31210814" id="u31210814"><span data-lake-id="u66206ba4" id="u66206ba4">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z_c%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc016f7317371205e4ec0354fc9cdb208.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U1wrN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbcb77df" id="ucbcb77df"> 为某个归一化因子，例如可以采用全局奖励的标准差。在数据收集过程中，我们为每个提示 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cIQmA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2552de63" id="u2552de63"> 采样生成 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22thsxr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96b409ab" id="u96b409ab"> 张图像，因此可以估计各提示对应的平均奖励 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7Dr%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Braw%7D%7D(x_0%2Cc)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e1ef8a9c46cc5be34429582d912e3b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ViVn4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18067c4e" id="u18067c4e">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0c98a801" id="u0c98a801"><strong><span data-lake-id="u75d08aad" id="u75d08aad">采样策略的软更新。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufd579341" id="ufd579341"> DiffusionNFT 的离策略性质，使采样策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec7a1145033857098f5d28785659fc07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hqrup%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcd9095a" id="ufcd9095a"> 与训练策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lk6vV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebb5fc3b" id="uebb5fc3b"> 相互解耦。因此，无需在每次迭代之后执行“硬”更新，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe357d643b7a3d4689ab0c61a05d2a643.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O6D4Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua82ce904" id="ua82ce904">。相反，我们利用这一性质，采用指数移动平均（Exponential Moving Average，EMA）形式的“软”更新：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf26fd086" id="uf26fd086" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Ceta_i%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%2B(1-%5C%5Ceta_i)%5C%5Ctheta.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb0485c4966ac0279c62aa10a38ed535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qerkj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue3b8db9f" id="ue3b8db9f"><span data-lake-id="ua892366b" id="ua892366b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O3d1D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u49b27179" id="u49b27179"> 为迭代次数。参数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7483c6745bb07f292eba02b3a9b55c26.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E36Ph%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71076834" id="u71076834"> 控制学习速度与稳定性之间的权衡。严格的同策略方案，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8e205514fa7f10e555a28aaf6487edd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YPDkc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b249b4f" id="u4b249b4f">，虽然能够在初期取得快速进展，但容易出现严重的不稳定性，导致灾难性崩溃。相反，接近离线训练的方案，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%5C%5Crightarrow1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49bb42d6e370e3b0b184aae5a7558624.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GeRQs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u417e7ec7" id="u417e7ec7">，虽然稳定性较强，但收敛速度过慢，难以满足实际需求，如图 8 所示。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc57cb8e5" id="uc57cb8e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf052c900" id="uf052c900">自适应损失加权。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u09182742" id="u09182742"> 标准扩散损失包含与时间相关的权重 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1015bd678f4bc6451d770a80c742cce1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vaJQN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf897747" id="uaf897747">，如式（1）所示。我们不进行人工调节，而是采用自适应加权方案。速度预测器 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd85da554ec76d3f694107121e1392b96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qo8hv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a078e2e" id="u1a078e2e"> 可以等价转换为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UnVMD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u417142a8" id="u417142a8"> 预测器，记为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe76a13c1316fe9509d86944858897395.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wklQd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63b31b4f" id="u63b31b4f">。例如，在 Rectified Flow 调度下，有 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%5C%5Ctheta%3Dx_t-tv_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F608a952cd58d7b350ce5b11ec0a576f7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o0xAk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueac69a56" id="ueac69a56">。受扩散蒸馏方法 DMD（Yin et al., 2024）的启发，我们用一种自归一化的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BGO7k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90d964f5" id="u90d964f5"> 回归形式，替代原有的加权方式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7c4ad14a" id="u7c4ad14a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w(t)%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-v%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cx_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-x_0%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Babs%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Cc%2Ct)-x_0%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31c4a25e1a4f21361ba2e62e93335c79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uvaEx%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9b3d3db8" id="u9b3d3db8"><span data-lake-id="u8ca21cae" id="u8ca21cae">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4aafaba0d33c8d7835bfa9e284b3e22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VhQji%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7fd60fe2" id="u7fd60fe2"> 为停止梯度算子。我们发现，这种方式通常能够加快训练，如图 9 所示。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue802c8f8" id="ue802c8f8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a0beff2" id="u6a0beff2">不使用 CFG 的优化。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6cf1f2ff" id="u6cf1f2ff"> 无分类器引导（CFG）（Ho &amp; Salimans, 2022）是推理时提升生成质量的一项默认技术，但它会增加后训练的复杂度，并降低效率。从概念上看，我们将 CFG 解释为强化引导的一种离线形式，如式（4）所示，其中条件模型与无条件模型分别对应正信号与负信号。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uefcdbf03" id="uefcdbf03"><span data-lake-id="u618ff365" id="u618ff365">基于这一理解，我们在算法设计中舍弃 CFG，仅使用条件模型初始化策略。尽管这一初始化看似较弱，但我们观察到，模型性能迅速提升，并很快超越使用 CFG 的基线，如图 1 所示。这表明，CFG 的功能能够通过强化学习后训练被有效学习或替代。这一发现也呼应了近期通过后训练、在不使用 CFG 的情况下取得强大性能的研究（Chen et al., 2025b;a；Zheng et al., 2025）。</span></p>